  (text "MONO BRAKE FAULT-PRIORITY MEMORY\nBRK_OK(next) = (BRK_RESET_ACTIVE OR BRK_OK) AND BRK_OC_N.\nNRST LOW restores permission only while overcurrent is absent.\nBRK_OC_N LOW always inhibits and removes stored permission.\nWith NRST HIGH, fault recovery alone cannot rearm.\nU55 independently gates the command with BRK_OC_N.\nValid-level startup checked; rail ramps, loop timing and energy remain open."
    (at 228.6 38.1 0)
